sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant R1 as Request A
    participant R2 as Request B (same key, same moment)
    participant P as Payment Service
    participant DB as payment_db
    participant G as Gateway

    par Simultaneous identical requests
        R1->>P: POST /payments (Idempotency-Key: k1)
        R2->>P: POST /payments (Idempotency-Key: k1)
    end

    P->>DB: INSERT idempotency_keys (k1, IN_PROGRESS)
    Note over DB: Primary key on idem_key:<br/>only ONE insert can win
    DB-->>P: Request A wins (insert OK)
    DB--xP: Request B loses (duplicate key / IntegrityError)

    P->>G: (A only) POST /charge
    G-->>P: 200 APPROVED
    P->>DB: UPDATE idempotency_keys SET status=DONE, response=...

    P-->>R2: 409 REQUEST_IN_PROGRESS (B asked while A still running)
    Note over R2,P: B retries shortly after
    R2->>P: POST /payments (Idempotency-Key: k1) [retry]
    P->>DB: SELECT idempotency_keys WHERE idem_key=k1
    DB-->>P: status=DONE, same response as A
    P-->>R2: 201 (identical response to A, gateway NOT charged again)

    P-->>R1: 201 APPROVED
